{"suite": "debugbench", "question_id": "debugbench_closest-nodes-queries-in-a-binary-search-tree_cpp", "prompt": "# Bug Fixing Task (CPP)\n\n## Problem Description\nYou are given the root of a binary search tree and an array queries of size n consisting of positive integers.\nFind a 2D array answer of size n where an", "expected": "/**\n * Definition for a binary tree node.\n * struct TreeNode {\n *     int val;\n *     TreeNode *left", "dataset_source": "hf_adapter", "prompt_hash": "e6fd43483db3", "timestamp": "2026-03-05T00:25:28.501340+00:00", "role_results": {"frontdoor:direct": {"role": "frontdoor", "mode": "direct", "answer": "## Solution\n```cpp\nclass Solution {\npublic:\n        void dfs(TreeNode* root, vector<int>& bv){\n            if (root == NULL)return; \n            if (root->left)dfs(root->left,bv);\n            bv.push_back(root->val);\n            if (root->right)dfs(root->right,bv);\n        }\n        \n        int min1(vector<int>& bv, int val){\n            int ans= -1;\n            int i=0; int j= bv.size()-1;\n            while (i<=j){\n                int mid= i+ (j-i)/2;\n                if (val == bv[mid])return val;\n                if (val < bv[mid]){\n                    ans = bv[mid];\n                    j = mid-1;\n                }\n                else i = mid+1;\n            }\n            return ans;\n        }\n\t\t\n    int max1(vector<int>& bv,int val){\n        int ans= -1;\n        int i=0; int j= bv.size()-1;\n        while (i<=j){\n            int mid= i+ (j-i)/2;\n            if (val == bv[mid])return val;\n            if (val < bv[mid]){\n                ans= bv[mid];\n                j= mid-1;\n            }\n            else i= mid+1;\n        }\n        return ans;\n    }\n\t\n        vector<vector<int>> closestNodes(TreeNode* root, vector<int>& queries) {\n            vector<int> bv;\n            dfs(root,bv);\n            vector<vector<int>> res;\n            for (int q: queries){\n                int minVal = min1(bv,q);\n                int maxVal = max1(bv,q);\n                res.push_back({minVal,maxVal});\n            }\n            return res;\n        }\n};\n```", "passed": false, "elapsed_seconds": 8.799998091068119, "error": null, "error_type": "none", "tokens_generated": 364, "tokens_generated_estimate": 0, "backend_task_id": 0, "slot_progress_source": "", "tools_used": 0, "tools_called": [], "delegation_events": [], "delegation_diagnostics": {}, "tools_success": null, "delegation_success": null, "routed_to": "frontdoor", "role_history": ["frontdoor"], "routing_strategy": "forced", "turns": 1, "tokens_used": 364, "formalization_applied": false, "cache_stats": {"frontdoor": {"router_total_routes": 1, "router_hit_rate": 0.0, "backend_hit_rate": 1.0, "backend_token_savings": 1.5725552050473186, "total_prompt_tokens": 634, "cached_prompt_tokens": 997, "slot_stats": [{"slot_id": 0, "prefix_hash": "fb3f4594...", "hit_count": 0, "miss_count": 1, "hit_rate": 0.0, "last_access": 1772670319.6875744}, {"slot_id": 1, "prefix_hash": "", "hit_count": 0, "miss_count": 0, "hit_rate": 0.0, "last_access": 1772670319.639388}, {"slot_id": 2, "prefix_hash": "", "hit_count": 0, "miss_count": 0, "hit_rate": 0.0, "last_access": 1772670319.6393886}, {"slot_id": 3, "prefix_hash": "", "hit_count": 0, "miss_count": 0, "hit_rate": 0.0, "last_access": 1772670319.639389}], "token_savings_pct": 157.25552050473186, "frontdoor_repl_bypass_enabled": true, "frontdoor_repl_bypass_count": 0}, "coder": {"router_total_routes": 0, "router_hit_rate": 0.0, "backend_hit_rate": 0.0, "backend_token_savings": 0.0, "total_prompt_tokens": 0, "cached_prompt_tokens": 0, "slot_stats": [{"slot_id": 0, "prefix_hash": "", "hit_count": 0, "miss_count": 0, "hit_rate": 0.0, "last_access": 1772670319.6425328}, {"slot_id": 1, "prefix_hash": "", "hit_count": 0, "miss_count": 0, "hit_rate": 0.0, "last_access": 1772670319.6425335}, {"slot_id": 2, "prefix_hash": "", "hit_count": 0, "miss_count": 0, "hit_rate": 0.0, "last_access"